OL,3,AIsraeli strike on Gaza hospital kills
OL,4,Asix Palestinians, health ministry says
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt least six people have been killed
OL,7,Fand about 20 injured in an Israeli air
OL,8,Fstrike on Nasser hospital, the biggest
OL,9,Fin the southern Gaza Strip, the
OL,10,FHamas-run health ministry says.
OL,12,FEyewitnesses told the BBC that a single
OL,13,Fmissile fired by a warplane hit a
OL,14,Fbuilding containing the surgical wards
OL,15,Fand intensive care units overnight.
OL,17,FThe health ministry said medical staff,
OL,18,Fpatients and companions were killed,
OL,19,Famong them surgeon Dr Rizk Abu Shaira.
OL,20,FIt condemned the attack as a "flagrant
OL,21,Fviolation of international laws and
OL,22,Fconventions".
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
