OL,3,AIsraeli strike on Gaza hospital kills
OL,4,Asix Palestinians, health ministry says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Israeli military said it targeted a
OL,7,Fcommander of Hamas's armed wing and
OL,8,Fother fighters who had used the
OL,9,Fhospital as a "headquarters" to plan
OL,10,Fattacks on its forces.
